function PersonalHabitEntry({habitId="",taskId="",initialRequest="",draftScope="",initialDate=""}:{habitId?:string;taskId?:string;initialRequest?:string;draftScope?:string;initialDate?:string}){const {world,run}=useProduct();const flow=useFlow();const {setState}=useStore();return <PersonalHabitWorkspace key={`${world.owner}:${habitId||taskId||draftScope||"new"}:${initialDate}`} world={world} run={run} habitId={habitId} taskId={taskId} initialRequest={initialRequest} draftScope={draftScope} initialDate={initialDate} onBack={()=>flow.pop()} onSaved={id=>flow.replace(personalHabitScreen(id))} onChuck={id=>refineOwnedPlanner(flow,setState,world,id)} onReminder={(id,date)=>{const reminders=world.objects.filter(o=>o.owner===world.owner&&o.kind==="reminder"&&o.sourceHabitId===id&&o.sourceHabitDate===date&&o.status!=="cancelled");flow.push(reminders.length>1?remindersScreen():reminderScreen(reminders[0]?.id||"",id,"","",date));}} onPlanDate={(id,date)=>flow.push(dayAgendaScreen("","","",`habit:${id}:${date}`,`habit-date:${encodeURIComponent(id)}:${date}`))}/>;}
