function WeekMealsEntry({objectId,taskId,request}:{objectId:string;taskId:string;request:string}){const {world,run,update}=useProduct(),{getState}=useStore(),flow=useFlow();const {draft,set}=useFeatureDraft(`week-meals:${objectId||taskId||'own'}`,{view:''});let view=emptyWeekMealView(world.owner);const original=ownMealWeeks(world).find(r=>r.id===objectId);if(original)view={owner:world.owner,selected:original.id,mode:'saved',draft:structuredClone(original.draft)};else if(taskId||request)view={...view,mode:'edit',draft:{...view.draft,request:request||view.draft.request}};try{const saved=JSON.parse(draft.view);if(saved?.owner===world.owner&&['list','edit','review','saved'].includes(saved.mode)&&typeof saved.selected==='string'&&saved.draft&&Array.isArray(saved.draft.days))view=saved;}catch{}if(view.selected&&ownMealWeeks(world).some(r=>r.id===view.selected)){try{const canonical=JSON.parse(world.drafts[`${world.owner}:week-meals:${view.selected}`]?.view||'null');if(canonical?.owner===world.owner&&canonical.selected===view.selected&&canonical.draft&&Array.isArray(canonical.draft.days))view=canonical;}catch{}}return <WeekMealPlanningWorkspace key={`${world.owner}:${objectId}:${taskId}`} world={world} run={run} objectId={objectId} taskId={taskId} request={request} viewState={view} onViewStateChange={next=>{if(next.owner!==world.owner)return;set('view',JSON.stringify(next));update(w=>{if(w.owner!==next.owner||!w.identity.signedIn)return w;const valid=!next.selected||ownMealWeeks(w).some(r=>r.id===next.selected);if(!valid)return w;const value={view:JSON.stringify(next)},drafts={...w.drafts,[`${w.owner}:week-meals:own`]:value};if(next.selected)drafts[`${w.owner}:week-meals:${next.selected}`]=value;return {...w,drafts};});if(objectId&&next.selected&&next.selected!==objectId){const r=ownMealWeeks(getState().world).find(r=>r.id===next.selected);if(r)flow.replace(weekMealsScreen(r.id,r.sourceTaskId,r.draft.request));}}} onSaved={id=>{if(id!==objectId){const r=ownMealWeeks(getState().world).find(r=>r.id===id);if(r)flow.replace(weekMealsScreen(r.id,r.sourceTaskId,r.draft.request));}}} onTask={id=>flow.push(featureScreen('AL-293',{objectId:id}))} onDay={id=>{const current=getState().world;if(current.identity.signedIn&&ownNutritionPlans(current).some(p=>p.id===id))flow.push(nutritionWorkspaceScreen('',id));}} onCreateDay={date=>flow.push(nutritionWorkspaceScreen('Plan my meals for this selected date.','',date))} onBack={()=>flow.pop()}/>;}
