function OwnSpotReturnFocus({opener,children}:{opener:HTMLElement|null;children:ReactNode}){const present=useIsPresent(),restored=useRef(false);const restore=()=>{if(!restored.current&&opener?.isConnected&&opener.getClientRects().length&&opener.closest('[data-flow-current="true"]')&&!opener.closest('[data-flow-current="false"]')){if(opener.closest('.web-device-recovery'))opener.scrollIntoView({block:'center',inline:'nearest'});opener.focus({preventScroll:true});restored.current=true;}};useEffect(()=>{if(present)return;const timer=window.setTimeout(restore,200);return()=>window.clearTimeout(timer);},[present,opener]);useEffect(()=>()=>{window.setTimeout(restore,50);},[opener]);return <>{children}</>;}
